"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F241304024828157%2Fposts%2F1396058172686064&title=%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09THANKFUL+THURSDAY+The+Gift+of+LifeAs+we+begin+the+month+of+October%2C+we+want+to+give+a+very+special+THANK+YOU+to+all+the+incredible+people+who+donate+blood+and+platelets+right+here+on+Cape+Cod.Many+of+you+do+it+quietly+and+stoically%2C+without+looking+for+recognition+or+praise.+Some+of+you+have+donated+gallons+over+the+years+and+have+helped+save+countless+lives+right+here+in+our+own+community.Because+of+you%2C+when+someone+walks+through+the+doors+of+Cape+Cod+Hospital+or+Falmouth+Hospital+and+needs+blood%2C+there+is+hope+waiting+for+them.The+need+is+constant.+And+every+drop+donated+stays+right+here+on+Cape+Cod.So+today%2C+from+Team+Rep+X%2C+a+BIG+SHOUT-OUT+to+every+donor+pictured+here+and+to+all+those+who+quietly+roll+up+their+sleeves+and+give+simply+because+they+want+to+help+someone+else.You+are+making+a+difference.+You+are+giving+the+gift+of+life.God+bless+you+all.+%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8%E2%9D%A4%EF%B8%8F%F0%9F%98%8A%F0%9F%99%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%F0%9F%A9%B8%F0%9F%91%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%23RepX+%23Fightin5th+%23ProudAmerican+%23ServiceBeforeSelf+%23Blood+%23BloodDonor+%23CCH+%23TheGiftofLife+%23CapeCod+%23Massachusetts+%23MaPoliCape+Cod+HealthcareCape+Cod+Healthcare+Blood+CenterThe+Nicholas+G.+Xiarhos+Memorial+Fund+%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F241304024828157%2Fposts%2F1396515965973618&title=%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09WELCOME+HOME%2C+PETE%21Injured+Barnstable+Police+Officer+Comes+HomeThank+you+to+everyone+who+took+the+time+to+come+out+tonight+to+welcome+home+a+Barnstable+hero.Barnstable+Police+Officer+Peter+Ginnetty+is+finally+home%2C+and+we+are+all+so+grateful.+He+is+lucky+to+be+alive+after+being+struck+at+high+speed+by+a+drunk+driver+while+directing+traffic.Peter+has+many+broken+bones+and+a+long+road+of+recovery+ahead%2C+but+thanks+to+the+skilled+hands+of+so+many+people+who+helped+him+along+the+way%2C+he+is+home.From+his+fellow+officers+at+the+scene%2C+to+the+Hyannis+firefighters%2C+the+emergency+department+staff+at+Cape+Cod+Hospital%2C+and+the+doctors%2C+nurses+and+medical+staff+in+Boston+who+performed+multiple+surgeries%2C+THANK+YOU+for+helping+bring+Peter+home.The+turnout+tonight+says+it+all.+So+many+people+came+out+to+show+Peter+and+his+family+how+much+we+care+and+how+much+we+respect+him+and+all+he+does+for+our+community.His+case+also+highlights+a+serious+problem+with+our+criminal+justice+system.+A+multiple-offender+drunk+driver+was+released+on+personal+recognizance%2C+while+taxpayers+had+to+pay+the+bail+commissioner+fee.+That+costs+Massachusetts+taxpayers+about+%247+million+a+year.The+person+who+commits+the+crime+should+pay+that+fee%2C+not+the+taxpayers%2C+and+certainly+not+Peter.That%E2%80%99s+another+battle+ahead.Tonight%2C+we%E2%80%99re+just+thankful+Peter+is+home.It+could+have+been+very+different.Have+a+peaceful+night+back+home+in+West+Barnstable%2C+Peter%2C+where+you+belong.We+are+all+grateful+to+have+you+home.%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8%F0%9F%92%99%F0%9F%98%8A%F0%9F%91%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%23RepX+%23Fightin5th+%23ProudAmerican+%23ServiceBeforeSelf+%23BackTheBlue+%23BPD+%23Barnstable+%23CapeCod+%23Massachusetts+%23MaPoliTown+of+BarnstableBarnstable+Police+DepartmentCape+Cod+HealthcareWest+Barnstable+Fire+DepartmentBarnstable+Police+K9++FoundationBarnstable+Police+School+Resource+Officer+UnitBarnstable+Police+Citizens+Academy+Network+%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F241304024828157%2Fposts%2F1396977275927487&title=%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09GOOD+MORNING+%26amp%3B+HAPPY+WEAR+RED+FRIDAY%21+Paint+It+ForwardWear+RED+today+to+Remember+Everyone+Deployed+around+the+world+serving+and+defending+our+nation+and+our+freedoms.I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+recognize+Sheldon+and+Sali+Stewart+of+Stewart+Painting%2C+who+I+had+the+honor+of+presenting+with+a+Special+Massachusetts+House+of+Representatives+Citation+recognizing+all+they+do+for+our+veterans+and+Gold+Star+families+across+Cape+Cod.One+great+example+is+their+%E2%80%98Paint+It+Forward%E2%80%99+campaign%2C+which+completely+rehabilitated+the+home+of+a+disabled+Vietnam+Veteran+and+his+family+right+here+in+Sandwich.+Seeing+the+pride+in+that+family%E2%80%99s+faces+was+incredible.That+is+community+service+at+its+best%21+Now+in+its+5th+year%2C+Paint+It+Forward+is+accepting+nominations+for+a+deserving+Cape+Cod+veteran+or+Gold+Star+family%2C+with+services+valued+at+up+to+%2410%2C000%21Nominate+someone+deserving%3A+https%3A%2F%2Fstewartpaint.com%2Fpaint-it-forward%2FThank+you%2C+Sheldon+and+Sali%2C+for+continuing+to+give+back+and+make+a+difference+for+those+who+served+and+sacrificed+for+our+country.WEAR+RED.+REMEMBER+EVERYONE+DEPLOYED.+HONOR+OUR+VETERANS.+HAVE+A+FANTASTIC+FIGHTIN%E2%80%99+5TH+FRIDAY%21%23RepX+%23Fightin5th+%23ServiceBeforeSelf+%23ProudAmerican+%23Veterans+%23CapeCod+%23Massachusetts+%23MaPoliStewart+PaintingCape+and+Islands+Veterans+Outreach+CenterSupport+Our+Troops+-+Wear+Red+Friday%26%23039%3Bs+%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fphoto.php%3Ffbid%3D1396267259331822%26amp%3Bset%3Da.241020898189803%26amp%3Btype%3D3&title=%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09GREAT+NEWS%21+OFFICER+GINNETTY+IS+COMING+HOME%2C+TODAY+AT+5%3A30%21Barnstable+Police+Officer+Peter+Ginnetty+is+finally+coming+home%21After+numerous+surgeries+and+weeks+in+a+Boston+hospital%2C+Peter+is+coming+home+to+his+family%2C+his+brothers+and+sisters+in+law+enforcement%2C+and+his+community.He+has+a+long+road+ahead+with+his+recovery%2C+but+today+we+celebrate+the+fact+that+HE+IS+ALIVE+AND+HE+IS+COMING+HOME%21Peter+was+nearly+killed+a+few+weeks+ago+when+he+was+struck+by+a+drunk+driver+while+directing+traffic+in+Hyannis.+He+and+his+family+have+been+overwhelmed+by+the+prayers%2C+support+and+help+they+have+received+from+so+many+people.Now+let%E2%80%99s+give+Peter+the+welcome+home+he+deserves%21If+you+can%2C+PLEASE+COME+OUT+AND+PACK+THE+ROTARY+AT+EXIT+65+IN+WEST+BARNSTABLE+as+Peter+comes+home+today+at+5%3A30PM+with+a+full+police+escort+around+the+rotary+and+over+the+First+Responder+Appreciation+Bridge.Bring+your+American+flag.+Bring+your+family.+Say+a+prayer.+Wave%2C+cheer+and+let+Peter+know+just+how+much+this+community+cares+about+him.Let%E2%80%99s+show+Officer+Ginnetty+and+his+family+that+everyone+in+the+FIGHTIN%E2%80%99+FIFTH+and+all+over+Cape+Cod+is+behind+them+all+the+way.WELCOME+HOME%2C+BROTHER%21%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8%F0%9F%92%99%F0%9F%98%8A%F0%9F%99%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%F0%9F%91%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%F0%9F%91%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%F0%9F%91%8F%F0%9F%8F%BB%23RepX+%23Fightin5th+Barnstable+Police+DepartmentTown+of+BarnstableWest+Barnstable+Fire+DepartmentBarnstable+Police+K9++FoundationWest+Barnstable+Civic+AssociationBarnstable+Police+Citizens+Academy+NetworkBarnstable+Police+School+Resource+Officer+Unit+%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09%09",
